OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors back calls for holiday
OL,4,Alet regulation
OL,5,
OL,6,FBath councillors have unanimously
OL,7,Fbacked calls for more regulation on
OL,8,Fshort-term lets, despite a number of
OL,9,Fcouncil members owning holiday lets
OL,10,Fthemselves.
OL,12,FAt a Bath and North East Somerset
OL,13,FCouncil meeting, councillors agreed
OL,14,Fthat a registration scheme and
OL,15,F"specific planning permission" should
OL,16,Fbe introduced for short-term lets to
OL,17,Ftackle Bath's housing crisis.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
