OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors back calls for holiday
OL,4,Alet regulation
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen councillor Saskia Heijltjes said
OL,7,Fmany people "struggle" to find an
OL,8,Faffordable home in Bath while Airbnb
OL,9,Falone "has over 1,880 active listings"
OL,10,Fin the city.
OL,12,FA dozen councillors, including council
OL,13,Fleader Kevin Guy, had to declare a
OL,14,Ffinancial interest ahead of the debate,
OL,15,Findicating that they or a family member
OL,16,Fowned a short-term let.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
